// SF-005-UI Dashboard profile: the only difference from config/openclaw/openclaw.json5
// (the offline profile). Applied to the live config with
// `scripts/openclaw/sf005-dashboard.sh enable` and removed again with `disable`;
// keep both steps in line with the keys below.
// The Gateway has no egress, so the UI's link favicon/preview fetches stay off.
// Everything else stays as in the offline profile: token auth, loopback bind,
// no operator terminal, no CLI agents, no HTTP model endpoints, no plugins,
// hooks, browser, exec or model provider.
{
  gateway: {
    controlUi: { enabled: true, automaticallyFetchFavicons: false },
  },
}
